ng Hub |\n| 49 | I | Arrived To Destination Hub |\n| 50 | I | On The Way To Collection Point |\n| 51 | I | Arrived At Collection Point |\n| 52 | I | Received At Collection Point |\n| 53 | I | Pending Fulfillment |\n| 54 | I | Picked Fulfillment |\n| 55 | I | Packed Fulfillment |\n| 56 | I | Shipped Fulfillment |\n| 57 | I | In Transit (internal) |\n| 58 | I | Arrived To Destination City |\n| 60 | F | Damaged |\n| 61 | I | Dispatch Failed |\n| 62 | I | Customs Clearance - Details Missing |\n| 63 | I | Customs Clearance - Details Received |\n| 68 | F | Disposed |\n| 69 | F | Relabeled |\n| 70 | F | Lost |\n| 73 | I | Address Updated |\n| 78 | I | Repacked |\n| 81 | I | Pickup Attempt Failed |\n| 82 | I | Delivery Attempt Failed |\n"
